{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1375268-idea-libertine-news","id":1375268,"title":"[Idea] Libertine News","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-03-17T05:41:20-07:00","id":1375268,"title":"[Idea] Libertine News","content":"In my Mage Chronicle, the Free Council offers a digital news outlet focused on supernatural stuff and Consilia politics for a little payment of monthly Mana at the Lorehouse. Greater payments unlock exclusive info, like in Patreon and Kickstarter. This outlet regularly gives info on which Mysteries are available, which Cabals are claiming/investigating them, important legal goings-on and more. Here is one example from said Chronicle:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> The homeless population of Seattle has always been more resourceful than those of other cities. And since the 1970s, it seems that they have enjoyed the protection of an elusive vigilante. Up until today, this entity has stayed out of the radars of the Consilium, but the Pixel Trinity Cabal has managed to photograph them in action and run the evidence through technological and magical analysis. The vigilante's identity has not been revealed yet, but there are already Awakened seeking to negotiate with the Pixel Trinity for bits of information.<br /> <br /> Nature Of The Mystery: Unknown<br /> Claimers: Pixel Trinity<br /> Location: Ambulatory, with a focus on crime and poverty-ridden areas<br /> Time: Nocturnal, almost always close to midnight<br /> Lex Magica Status: Open<br /> Suggestions &amp; Observations: The vigilante is known for multi-Arcana cloaking abilities and homicidal behavior toward those who have repeatedly assaulted or harassed the homeless. They have also been sighted in the Shadow of Seattle, implying some link to the spiritual ecosystem. Engage with caution and have your Knowing &amp; Unveiling spells ready. </div> </div> </div>Seers would be blacklisted from this service, but would have their own version, probably initiated by Chancellor + Eye.<br /> <br /> Would you use this in your Chronicles? If yes, what sort of news would the Free Council write in your Consilium?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-17T13:27:33-07:00","id":1375320,"title":"","content":"I've been running a game set in 2005 (when the 1e core was published), so I'm using <i>Adept</i>, the Libertine rip-off of MySpace. This kinda sounds like something that'd grow out of that, assuming Adept didn't go the same way as it's inspiration.<br /> <br /> Presumably, you'd get reports of major decisions and cases done in consilia across the world.<br /> <br /> In my consilium, I'd see one of the NPCs spamming it with adverts for their open-mic poetry night at the Emerald Scroll in Boston.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-17T19:19:24-07:00","id":1375367,"title":"","content":"I would probably make it into a station about &quot;fantasy mystery&quot; shows. Then borrow liberally from the quotes from Unknown Armies for plot hooks:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://projects.inklesspen.com/fatal-and-friends/oriongates/unknown-armies/\" target=\"_blank\">https://projects.inklesspen.com/fata...nknown-armies/</a><br /> <br /> I would also make a sci-fi news show with Hidden High Speech job postings: &quot;Fans were elated when they announced the new season of Shadow Raiders, but we wonder how it will measure up to the 90s cult classic (There are reports of phones with a specific ring tone that can act as a gateway to a Forces attuned Twilight, the Mysterium will grant a major boon to anyone who delivers a copy).&quot;<br /> <br /> It could be a way to place dots to be connected later, the occasional side quest that let the party have a break in pacing after more hectic parts of the main plot.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 03-18-2020, 09:38 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}